mension\",\"description\":\"Total Z extent of the finished L-bracket = BASE_THICKNESS (6) + ARM_HEIGHT (40) = 46 mm, measured from Z=0 bottom face to Z=46 arm top.\",\"nominal\":46.0,\"tolerance_upper\":0.5,\"tolerance_lower\":-0.5,\"face_selector_expression\":null,\"edge_selector_expression\":null,\"reference_feature_id\":null,\"measurement_axis\":\"z\",\"critical\":true,\"notes\":\"ABSOLUTE value: arm height is stated '40 mm tall' ABOVE the 6 mm base, so the QA bounding-box Z must read 46, not 40.\"},{\"id\":\"single-body\",\"kind\":\"single_body\",\"description\":\"Base and vertical arm MUST be fused into exactly one connected solid (one body, no loose parts).\",\"nominal\":1.0,\"tolerance_upper\":0.0,\"tolerance_lower\":0.0,\"face_selector_expression\":null,\"edge_selector_expression\":null,\"reference_feature_id\":null,\"measurement_axis\":null,\"critical\":true,\"notes\":\"Solid count in the final compound/part must equal 1.\"},{\"id\":\"water-tightness\",\"kind\":\"water_tightness\",\"description\":\"Final mesh/solid MUST be a closed manifold (watertight) with no open or non-manifold edges; the two 5 mm through-holes must be closed cylindrical walls.\",\"nominal\":1.0,\"tolerance_upper\":0.0,\"tolerance_lower\":0.0,\"face_selector_expression\":null,\"edge_selector_expression\":null,\"reference_feature_id\":null,\"measurement_axis\":null,\"critical\":true,\"notes\":\"1.0 = watertight/valid, 0.0 = leaks. Holes are through-holes so both top and bottom face openings must be capped by the cut's cylindrical wall.\"}],\"functional_requirements\":[\"Base bottom face (Z=0) MUST be a single flat plane so the bracket sits flush on a mounting surface.\",\"The two 5 mm diameter base holes are fastener clearance holes (suitable for M4 screws) for mounting the bracket to a flat surface.\",\"The vertical arm transmits a vertical/in-plane load into the base; the base-to-arm junction is the primary bending region and must remain a continuous solid (a fillet may be added there 